<title>ITALY: Venice airport air cargo down 3.5 pct in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>Venice airport air cargo down 3.5 pct in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic at Venice's Marco Polo airport in February fell 3.5 percent to 1,056 tonnes against the same period 1996, the airport's managing authority SAVE said.</p>
<p>			   Feb 97    Pct	   Jan-Feb 97   Pct</p>
<p>					 Change			 Change</p>
<p> Cargo (Tonnes)	  1,056   down 3.5	1,976	down 8.2</p>
<p> Aircraft movements    2,817   down 5.1	5,997	down 1.0</p>
<p> Passengers	    173,487   down 0.3    347,453	up   2.7</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
